{"siteId":"68108c29063eeb5d1bd7ae4a","pageId":"68108c2a063eeb5d1bd7ae90","context":"Replace Deal Desk HtmlEmbed with polish-v2 HTML plus CDN stylesheet link.","actions":[{"label":"set_polish_v2","set_settings":{"operations":[{"label":"embed_code","element_id":{"component":"68108c2a063eeb5d1bd7ae90","element":"a64ef2f7-2f5f-ab92-9711-5f43f9eeb3fa"},"settings":[{"key":"code","static_text":{"value":"<link id=\"oh-deal-desk\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68108c29063eeb5d1bd7ae4a/6a6bdf56570ac7789fe12096_oh-deal-desk-polish-v2.css\">\n<div class=\"dealality-problem-desk\" data-dealality-problem-desk data-story-state=\"final\" data-visual=\"polish-v2\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n  <p class=\"dpd-sr-only\">One hotel opportunity is distributed across separate brand, operator, advisor, and capital workstreams. Each workstream generates different emails, proposals, spreadsheets, notes, and requests. The responses use different information and assumptions, making comparison difficult. One path may gain momentum before other credible options are fully evaluated, leaving potential value undiscovered.</p>\n  <div class=\"dpd-desk\">\n    <svg class=\"dpd-flow-lines\" viewBox=\"0 0 1180 420\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <defs>\n        <linearGradient id=\"dpdFlowGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#9B8AFB\" stop-opacity=\".55\"/><stop offset=\"55%\" stop-color=\"#60A5FA\" stop-opacity=\".28\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#9B8AFB\" stop-opacity=\".12\"/></linearGradient>\n      </defs>\n      <path d=\"M210 95 C260 95, 270 78, 320 78\" stroke=\"url(#dpdFlowGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M210 175 C255 175, 270 150, 320 150\" stroke=\"url(#dpdFlowGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M210 255 C255 255, 270 230, 320 230\" stroke=\"url(#dpdFlowGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M210 330 C255 330, 270 310, 320 310\" stroke=\"url(#dpdFlowGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M560 210 C610 210, 640 210, 690 210\" stroke=\"url(#dpdFlowGrad)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n      <path d=\"M900 120 C940 120, 960 95, 990 70\" stroke=\"#9B8AFB\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".35\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 4\"/>\n      <path d=\"M900 210 C945 210, 970 210, 1005 210\" stroke=\"#9B8AFB\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".55\"/>\n      <path d=\"M900 300 C940 300, 960 330, 990 355\" stroke=\"#9B8AFB\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".28\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 4\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"dpd-flow\">\n      <section class=\"dpd-zone dpd-zone--1 dpd-opp\" data-zone=\"1\" aria-label=\"Hotel opportunity\">\n        <p class=\"dpd-zone-label\">Opportunity</p>\n        <div class=\"dpd-hotel-card\">\n          <div class=\"dpd-hotel-media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <img class=\"dpd-hotel-img\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68108c29063eeb5d1bd7ae4a/6a6bde85c014ee4e80e65c24_deal-desk-coastal-hotel-480.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"320\" decoding=\"async\"/>\n            <div class=\"dpd-hotel-shade\"></div>\n            <span class=\"dpd-hotel-chip\">Owner-Led Review</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dpd-opp-copy\">\n            <p class=\"dpd-opp-title\">One Hotel Opportunity</p>\n            <p class=\"dpd-opp-meta\">Coastal Select-Service Hotel</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dpd-fields\">\n          <div class=\"dpd-field\"><span class=\"dpd-field-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Owner Objectives</span></div>\n          <div class=\"dpd-field\"><span class=\"dpd-field-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Market Context</span></div>\n          <div class=\"dpd-field\"><span class=\"dpd-field-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Commercial Priorities</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"dpd-zone dpd-zone--2\" data-zone=\"2\" aria-label=\"Four separate workstreams\">\n        <p class=\"dpd-zone-label\">Workstreams</p>\n        <div class=\"dpd-lanes\">\n          <div class=\"dpd-lane dpd-lane--brand\">\n            <div class=\"dpd-lane-h\"><div class=\"dpd-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"dpd-lane-name\">Brand Team</p></div>\n            <div class=\"dpd-arts\">\n              <article class=\"dpd-doc dpd-doc--email\" aria-label=\"Email preview\">\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-stack\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-body\">\n                  <div class=\"dpd-mail-head\"><span class=\"dpd-mail-dot\"></span><span class=\"dpd-mail-from\">Brand Dev</span></div>\n                  <p class=\"dpd-mail-subj\">Flag opportunity?</p>\n                  <div class=\"dpd-mail-lines\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"dpd-doc-cap\">Email</p>\n              </article>\n              <article class=\"dpd-doc dpd-doc--proposal\" aria-label=\"Proposal cover\">\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-stack\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-body dpd-proposal\">\n                  <span class=\"dpd-prop-badge\">PDF</span>\n                  <div class=\"dpd-prop-cover\"><span></span><b></b><i></i></div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"dpd-doc-cap\">Proposal</p>\n              </article>\n              <article class=\"dpd-doc dpd-doc--deck\" aria-label=\"Slide deck\">\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-stack dpd-doc-stack--deck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n                <div class=\"dpd-doc-body dpd-slides\"><span></span><span></span></div>\n                <p class=\"dpd-doc-cap\">Deck</p>\n              </article>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dpd-lane dpd-lane--operator\">\n            <div class=\"dpd-lane-h\"><div class=\"dpd-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"